                                                "example_id": "dd1498ac-9709-4e4d-8964-79bf415d647b",
                                                "sense_id": "7bb14b0e-9045-38a6-b370-c6f5f114151e",
                                                "text": "The wide plain gauzed into a sea on which the hut floated lonely."
